menu "pw_allocator"

config PIGWEED_ALLOCATOR
  bool "Use the pw_allocator_zephyr module"
  help
    Zephyr-backed allocator implementations for pw_allocator. This doesn't
    link them: link pw_allocator_zephyr.system_heap_allocator or
    pw_allocator_zephyr.synchronized_heap_allocator to the code that uses it.

endmenu
